      "statement": "positive_class_ece <= 0.05 且低于同骨干基线 的同类指标",
      "basis": "literature",
      "derivation": {
        "value": 0.05,
        "bin_count": 15,
        "convention": "guo2017",
        "apply_to": "positive_class_ece",
        "basis": "literature",
        "citation": "Guo, Pleiss, Sun & Weinberger, ICML 2017, §5",
        "caveat": "整体 ECE 在正类占比 ~6.5% 时会退化到接近 0 (绝大多数样本落在\"预测≈0 / 真实≈0\"的箱内), 因此 0.05 必须作用于类别质量加权的正类 ECE"
